      <!-- LEFT COLUMN — Copy -->
      <div class="section-solution-copy">
        <h2 class="section-solution-headline">Your data is already enough.</h2>

        <p class="section-solution-subhead"><strong>NEXTGRES doesn't replace your infrastructure. It sits on top of it.</strong></p>

        <p class="section-solution-body">One virtualization layer connects read-only to your SQL databases, NoSQL stores, and event streams. It determines which behavioral signals matter and ingests only what's needed — no pipelines to build, no data warehouse required.</p>

        <p class="section-solution-body section-solution-body--tight">When a user's behavior changes mid-session — a plan upgrade, a skipped episode, an abandoned cart — NEXTGRES sees the signal and acts on it instantly, across every touchpoint.</p>

        <ul class="section-solution-proofs">
          <li>Read-only connections — your source systems are never modified</li>
          <li>Schema-agnostic — works regardless of how your data is structured</li>
          <li>Sub-second inference — acts on behavioral signals as they happen</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

